invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_vector.c
catches: mlkem_vector_equiv_test
reason: the forward layer of span 8 reads the twiddle factor one entry
  past the one mlk_poly_ntt reads for its block. The code is common to
  both instruction sets, so the equivalence test on either finds the
  coefficients that differ from the loops'.

--- old
    butterfly(&a, &b, twiddle_at(16 + block));
--- new
    butterfly(&a, &b, twiddle_at(17 + block));
